                <pb facs="0416" n="342" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg342"/>


                <head>Mr. Bigelow to Mr.
                        Davison</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Legation,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Paris,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-24"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 24, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have received the address of the citizens
                    of Paw which, at the request of your consular agent at that place, you were good
                    enough to send me. It will be placed among the archives of the legation.</p>
                <p>Yours, very respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN BIGELOW.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>C. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davison,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >United States Consul at Bordeaux.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
